[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3637063167","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113782#issuecomment-3637063167","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113782","id":3637063167,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YyS3_","user":{"login":"JJCUBER","id":34446698,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDQ2Njk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34446698?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER","html_url":"https://github.com/JJCUBER","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-10T13:20:52Z","updated_at":"2025-12-10T13:24:30Z","body":"@AThousandShips Sorry for the delay, I have committed everything.  There is an odd potential bug though: $20/2.9$ is truncated/floored instead of rounded by *only* printing of `Vector4i / float`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3637063167/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3637073108","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113782#issuecomment-3637073108","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113782","id":3637073108,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YyVTU","user":{"login":"JJCUBER","id":34446698,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDQ2Njk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34446698?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER","html_url":"https://github.com/JJCUBER","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-10T13:23:26Z","updated_at":"2025-12-10T13:24:04Z","body":"For example,\r\n```python\r\nprint(20/2.9)\r\nprint(Vector2i(20, 20)/ 2.9)\r\nprint(Vector3i(20, 20, 20)/ 2.9)\r\nprint(Vector4i(20, 20, 20, 20)/ 2.9)\r\n```\r\nyields\r\n```\r\n6.89655172413793\r\n(6.896552, 6.896552)\r\n(6.896552, 6.896552, 6.896552)\r\n(6.896551, 6.896551, 6.896551, 6.896551)\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3637073108/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3637098129","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113782#issuecomment-3637098129","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113782","id":3637098129,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YybaR","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-10T13:30:02Z","updated_at":"2025-12-10T13:30:02Z","body":"That's expected, the number of displayed digits is partially for ease of use, but this is also because `VectorN` uses single precision numbers normally, so it'll also be less precise, to print with more digits use `\"%.14v\" % [v]` with your vector","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3637098129/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3637126932","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113782#issuecomment-3637126932","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113782","id":3637126932,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YyicU","user":{"login":"JJCUBER","id":34446698,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDQ2Njk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34446698?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER","html_url":"https://github.com/JJCUBER","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJCUBER/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-10T13:36:03Z","updated_at":"2025-12-10T13:36:03Z","body":"> That's expected, the number of displayed digits is partially for ease of use, but this is also because `VectorN` uses single precision numbers normally, so it'll also be less precise, to print with more digits use `\"%.14v\" % [v]` with your vector\r\n\r\nIt still has a different amount of precision in the inherent calculation for `Vector4` specifically, which is odd considering they all should have the same precision (according to the docs), along with this toy example:\r\n```python\r\n  print(\"%.14v\" % [Vector2i(20, 20)/ 2.9])\r\n  print(\"%.14v\" % [Vector3i(20, 20, 20)/ 2.9])\r\n  print(\"%.14v\" % [Vector4i(20, 20, 20, 20)/ 2.9])\r\n  print(\"%.14v\" % [Vector4(20/2.9, 20/2.9, 20/2.9, 20/2.9)])\r\n\r\n\"\"\"\r\n(6.89655160903931, 6.89655160903931)\r\n(6.89655160903931, 6.89655160903931, 6.89655160903931)\r\n(6.89655113220215, 6.89655113220215, 6.89655113220215, 6.89655113220215) # !!\r\n(6.89655160903931, 6.89655160903931, 6.89655160903931, 6.89655160903931)\r\n\"\"\"\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3637126932/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3637150096","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113782#issuecomment-3637150096","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113782","id":3637150096,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YyoGQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-10T13:42:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-10T13:42:00Z","body":"Can confirm, it's probably due to an incorrect assumption in the writing of the code which for `Vector4` uses `v * 1 / d` instead of dividing each element by the value\r\n\r\nI'll open an issue for this, it's unrelated to the `Vector4i` case, as you can see with `Vector4(20, 20, 20, 20) / 2.9`","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3637150096/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"